  "term": "life goal",
  "definition": "A life goal is a broad aim or valued direction a person pursues, reflected in daily activities that help move them toward a hoped-for future or ideal self. In this source, life goals are treated as higher-level aims such as being fit, helpful, smart, talented, creative, or social.",
